        <mxCell id="AZkzkRU9zzAwxuQuecVx-99" value="k8s Secrets are mounted into Pods as &lt;b&gt;env variables&lt;/b&gt; or &lt;b&gt;files&lt;/b&gt;, enabling applications to access them without embedding sensitive data in container images" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
