        <mxCell id="AZkzkRU9zzAwxuQuecVx-103" value="k8s Secrets are stored in &lt;b&gt;etcd&lt;/b&gt;. Enable encryption at rest in etcd in EKS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
