        <mxCell id="AZkzkRU9zzAwxuQuecVx-104" value="We can also use &lt;b&gt;envelope encryption&lt;/b&gt; to encrypt Secrets values before writing to the etcd" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
