        <mxCell id="XwgDIaC6WEWvp0HOkpPq-25" value="1. Scheduler picks a node based on pod constraints.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. CSI Driver creates the EBS volume in that &lt;b data-index-in-node=&quot;107&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;exact same zone&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
