        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XwgDIaC6WEWvp0HOkpPq-29" value="If the AZ fails, the pod is stuck. It cannot reschedule to a healthy AZ because its data (the EBS volume) is trapped in the dead AZ" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
